1
00:02:21,419 --> 00:02:22,060
Well?

2
00:02:23,139 --> 00:02:24,520
Isn't autumn most alive

3
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:25,900
here at Redleaf?

4
00:02:28,259 --> 00:02:29,560
Fair.

5
00:02:31,360 --> 00:02:32,599
Every maple tree here

6
00:02:33,159 --> 00:02:34,699
is meticulously cared for.

7
00:02:35,860 --> 00:02:37,199
There's nowhere else like it here.

8
00:02:40,819 --> 00:02:42,099
For all their beauty,

9
00:02:42,900 --> 00:02:44,419
they'll be gone in the blink of an eye.

10
00:02:46,060 --> 00:02:48,060
Vibrant this minute,

11
00:02:48,860 --> 00:02:51,560
forlorn the next.

12
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:56,319
Don't read into it.

13
00:02:58,000 --> 00:02:59,219
We'll come back here

14
00:03:00,099 --> 00:03:01,620
again and again, if it pleases you.

15
00:03:07,759 --> 00:03:09,319
Have you forgotten, young master,

16
00:03:11,020 --> 00:03:12,319
that whatever there is

17
00:03:13,099 --> 00:03:13,900
between us

18
00:03:13,900 --> 00:03:15,500
is reciprocity, pure business.

19
00:03:16,159 --> 00:03:17,580
The future's never in the picture.

20
00:03:34,159 --> 00:03:35,300
Do I have to remind you, then,

21
00:03:36,259 --> 00:03:37,599
that I get to decide the duration

22
00:03:38,500 --> 00:03:39,400
of your stay?

23
00:03:53,719 --> 00:03:54,319
Now what?

24
00:03:55,620 --> 00:03:57,520
You still want Jiang Xueting out or not?

25
00:04:11,259 --> 00:04:12,419
That's more like it.

26
00:04:15,099 --> 00:04:16,740
Stop moping about all the time.

27
00:04:28,699 --> 00:04:29,519
Don't worry.

28
00:04:30,899 --> 00:04:31,959
I'll give it one year, tops.

29
00:04:33,519 --> 00:04:34,560
When I've had enough of you,

30
00:04:35,399 --> 00:04:36,439
I'll let you go.

31
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:34,920
A sudden flare-up? How so?

32
00:05:35,420 --> 00:05:36,180
It can be concluded

33
00:05:36,339 --> 00:05:37,319
that Mrs. Ye has developed

34
00:05:37,319 --> 00:05:38,459
nodules in her lungs.

35
00:05:38,560 --> 00:05:39,959
They need to be surgically removed.

36
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:41,360
Then get a move on!

37
00:05:42,500 --> 00:05:43,379
I'm terribly sorry.

38
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:44,360
I'm afraid we haven't had

39
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:45,339
the expertise for this yet.

40
00:05:45,519 --> 00:05:46,000
We learned

41
00:05:46,180 --> 00:05:47,399
there's a specialist in Jinping,

42
00:05:47,500 --> 00:05:47,879
a Dr. Wei,

43
00:05:48,040 --> 00:05:49,300
who's capable of it.

44
00:05:49,819 --> 00:05:50,959
We've contacted him.

45
00:05:51,300 --> 00:05:52,019
Unfortunately,

46
00:05:52,100 --> 00:05:53,920
he's leaving for Guangzhou tomorrow.

47
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:54,839
Apparently, he's put

48
00:05:54,839 --> 00:05:56,000
all his work on hold.

49
00:05:57,360 --> 00:05:57,980
His address.

50
00:06:07,300 --> 00:06:07,959
Changxuan,

51
00:06:08,620 --> 00:06:09,519
it's running late,

52
00:06:09,860 --> 00:06:11,079
and we have a mountain to cross.

53
00:06:11,420 --> 00:06:11,959
I'll go.

54
00:06:12,019 --> 00:06:12,480
Exactly,

55
00:06:12,620 --> 00:06:13,660
leave it to us.

56
00:06:14,160 --> 00:06:14,959
I'm going myself.

57
00:08:16,100 --> 00:08:17,220
Excuse me. I'm here to see Dr. Wei.

58
00:08:17,639 --> 00:08:18,120
I'm sorry,

59
00:08:18,120 --> 00:08:18,980
we're closed for the day.

60
00:08:22,899 --> 00:08:24,040
What's wrong with you?

61
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:24,740
I told you we're closed!

62
00:08:24,779 --> 00:08:25,360
What's going on?

63
00:08:25,639 --> 00:08:26,800
He keeps barging in.

64
00:08:26,860 --> 00:08:27,519
I told him

65
00:08:27,519 --> 00:08:28,459
we're closed for the day.

66
00:08:28,759 --> 00:08:29,620
I'm sorry, Dr. Wei.

67
00:08:29,899 --> 00:08:30,939
A family of mine has a lung infection

68
00:08:31,180 --> 00:08:32,179
and is coughing up blood.

69
00:08:32,559 --> 00:08:33,679
She needs surgery immediately.

70
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:34,799
Sir,

71
00:08:34,799 --> 00:08:35,919
I'm terribly sorry,

72
00:08:36,120 --> 00:08:37,600
but I'm sailing to Guangzhou tomorrow.

73
00:08:37,700 --> 00:08:38,659
I really can't help you.

74
00:08:38,860 --> 00:08:40,639
Perhaps you could try another doctor.

75
00:08:44,980 --> 00:08:46,039
Name your price.

76
00:08:46,500 --> 00:08:47,860
I'm taking you with me tonight.

77
00:08:48,039 --> 00:08:48,740
I'm sorry, but

78
00:08:49,039 --> 00:08:50,259
this isn't about money.

79
00:08:50,539 --> 00:08:52,460
It's a matter of timing.

80
00:09:02,019 --> 00:09:03,200
Is it good timing now?

81
00:09:16,820 --> 00:09:17,480
Miss Ye,

82
00:09:17,820 --> 00:09:19,179
they just made fresh lotus pastries.

83
00:09:19,299 --> 00:09:20,480
Shall I fetch some for you?

84
00:09:21,559 --> 00:09:23,259
Not now. I don't have much of an appetite.

85
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:24,860
Miss Ye,

86
00:09:25,159 --> 00:09:26,240
I can tell just

87
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:28,159
how much young master treasures you.

88
00:09:28,639 --> 00:09:29,840
Redleaf used to be

89
00:09:29,840 --> 00:09:31,059
a deserted place.

90
00:09:31,279 --> 00:09:32,340
You're the first woman

91
00:09:32,340 --> 00:09:33,059
he's ever brought home.

92
00:09:35,820 --> 00:09:37,460
Isn't your cousin in the army?

93
00:09:39,019 --> 00:09:40,480
You'd better tell him to be

94
00:09:41,100 --> 00:09:42,340
extra careful in his manners

95
00:09:42,620 --> 00:09:43,720
these couple of days.

96
00:09:44,200 --> 00:09:45,000
What's that?

97
00:09:45,100 --> 00:09:46,659
You heard something?

98
00:09:46,899 --> 00:09:48,240
It's about the spy, of course.

99
00:09:48,620 --> 00:09:50,200
They're cracking down on any indiscipline.

100
00:09:50,960 --> 00:09:51,960
That cousin or yours is

101
00:09:52,519 --> 00:09:53,600
quite a broad-brush one, isn't he?

102
00:09:55,559 --> 00:09:56,379
Now I remember.

103
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:57,899
Didn't he come back from overseas

104
00:09:57,899 --> 00:09:59,500
working as an interpreter?

105
00:10:00,559 --> 00:10:01,679
What's happened to him?

106
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:02,860
Guess what?

107
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:07,240
Shot on the spot

108
00:10:07,600 --> 00:10:08,559
earlier today.

109
00:10:09,360 --> 00:10:10,539
After all the trouble

110
00:10:10,700 --> 00:10:11,899
he caused us,

111
00:10:12,399 --> 00:10:13,320
one bullet would be

112
00:10:13,879 --> 00:10:14,720
too much of a mercy.

113
00:10:15,059 --> 00:10:15,980
For sure.

114
00:10:18,960 --> 00:10:19,840
Xueting!

115
00:10:20,919 --> 00:10:21,860
Xueting!

116
00:10:30,399 --> 00:10:30,980
Dr. Wei,

117
00:10:31,100 --> 00:10:31,840
how's it going?

118
00:10:32,960 --> 00:10:33,580
Mr. Yu.

119
00:10:33,799 --> 00:10:35,139
Just how ignorant I was! To have you

120
00:10:35,259 --> 00:10:35,720
go all the way...

121
00:10:35,720 --> 00:10:36,500
The surgery.

122
00:10:36,500 --> 00:10:37,139
How did it go?

123
00:10:38,039 --> 00:10:39,059
Rest assured.

124
00:10:39,120 --> 00:10:40,419
It went swimmingly.

125
00:10:40,500 --> 00:10:41,440
The only thing left to do

126
00:10:41,440 --> 00:10:42,379
is rest and recover.

127
00:10:45,399 --> 00:10:46,559
Now what else's keeping you?

128
00:10:46,759 --> 00:10:47,539
After a night's driving,

129
00:10:47,539 --> 00:10:48,220
and getting yourself injured,

130
00:10:48,220 --> 00:10:49,500
go home and have a proper rest.

131
00:10:49,740 --> 00:10:50,580
Boren's right.

132
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:51,860
We'll stay here.

133
00:10:52,200 --> 00:10:52,899
We'll keep

134
00:10:52,899 --> 00:10:53,779
a close eye on her.

135
00:10:54,200 --> 00:10:55,220
I'll drive you home.

136
00:10:55,259 --> 00:10:55,860
No. To Redleaf.

137
00:10:56,059 --> 00:10:56,980
I've been away for a day.

138
00:10:57,360 --> 00:10:58,259
I want to check on her first.

139
00:11:54,559 --> 00:11:55,460
Still up at this hour?

140
00:12:05,559 --> 00:12:06,679
I was waiting for you.

141
00:12:21,059 --> 00:12:21,860
If I may...

142
00:12:38,759 --> 00:12:39,179
Here.

143
00:12:54,419 --> 00:12:55,820
You seem in a good mood.

144
00:13:00,559 --> 00:13:02,419
Each day that passes

145
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:04,460
brings Xueting closer

146
00:13:04,679 --> 00:13:05,899
to freedom.

147
00:13:06,559 --> 00:13:07,919
How could I not be?

148
00:13:15,620 --> 00:13:17,220
I've told you this so many times.

149
00:13:18,659 --> 00:13:20,220
Why won't you ever learn?

150
00:13:28,120 --> 00:13:30,159
Can't you just leave him alone?

151
00:13:31,899 --> 00:13:32,559
Should I?

152
00:13:40,019 --> 00:13:41,340
So you did kill him!

153
00:13:50,600 --> 00:13:51,320
I beg your pardon?

154
00:13:51,820 --> 00:13:52,679
Yu Changxuan.

155
00:13:54,820 --> 00:13:55,899
All this time, you've

156
00:13:55,899 --> 00:13:57,120
been nothing but a nasty liar.

157
00:14:00,440 --> 00:14:02,500
You had him executed today, didn't you?

158
00:14:12,120 --> 00:14:12,580
That's right.

159
00:14:14,659 --> 00:14:15,519
I killed him.

160
00:14:17,659 --> 00:14:18,399
What are you gonna do?

161
00:14:20,799 --> 00:14:21,860
Killing me now?

162
00:14:22,179 --> 00:14:23,360
Of course I am.

163
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:31,000
Lo and behold,

164
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:32,399
how love makes one strong!

165
00:14:34,100 --> 00:14:36,000
I should've let you

166
00:14:36,559 --> 00:14:38,000
meet each other for the last time,

167
00:14:38,519 --> 00:14:40,159
so you star-crossed lovers

168
00:14:41,519 --> 00:14:43,320
could have one last good cuddle and cry.

169
00:14:47,539 --> 00:14:48,519
Yu Changxuan!

170
00:14:51,820 --> 00:14:52,519
Do you know just

171
00:14:52,519 --> 00:14:53,899
how much I want you dead right now?

172
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:57,659
Enlighten me.

173
00:14:57,919 --> 00:14:58,820
I want you to

174
00:14:58,820 --> 00:14:59,960
turn forever in hell!

175
00:14:59,960 --> 00:15:01,519
I want you denied of salvation!

176
00:15:03,200 --> 00:15:03,919
Funny.

177
00:15:05,759 --> 00:15:07,320
Right before he died,

178
00:15:08,600 --> 00:15:10,720
Jiang Xueting said the exact same thing.

179
00:15:18,620 --> 00:15:19,759
Go on. Shoot me!

180
00:15:20,120 --> 00:15:21,120
You wanna avenge him?

181
00:15:22,500 --> 00:15:24,460
Then take better aim

182
00:15:25,159 --> 00:15:26,120
and shoot!

183
00:15:27,159 --> 00:15:27,960
Shoot!

184
00:15:30,120 --> 00:15:31,000
Come on, shoot!

185
00:16:53,720 --> 00:16:55,720
I was this close.

186
00:16:57,700 --> 00:16:58,639
Just this close

187
00:16:58,639 --> 00:17:00,440
and I would've killed you.

188
00:17:10,200 --> 00:17:10,859
That's right.

189
00:17:13,500 --> 00:17:14,519
What a shame.

190
00:17:18,420 --> 00:17:19,160
And now

191
00:17:19,160 --> 00:17:20,740
be a good lamb and stay by my side,

192
00:17:23,240 --> 00:17:24,380
biding your time.

193
00:17:30,799 --> 00:17:32,319
Until you send me to hell.

194
00:17:59,900 --> 00:18:01,059
Drinking all by yourself, gorgeous?

195
00:18:03,220 --> 00:18:04,660
Care for a dance tonight?

196
00:18:06,359 --> 00:18:06,720
Damn...

197
00:18:07,099 --> 00:18:08,359
My sis had this custom made

198
00:18:08,359 --> 00:18:09,119
in Paris for me!

199
00:18:09,119 --> 00:18:09,900
What's that supposed to...

200
00:18:10,059 --> 00:18:10,539
All right.

201
00:18:10,640 --> 00:18:11,519
Come on, let's go.

202
00:18:14,740 --> 00:18:15,380
See? She just...

203
00:18:18,559 --> 00:18:19,319
What's gotten into her?

204
00:18:19,319 --> 00:18:20,299
Fuming like hell all of a sudden.

205
00:18:20,319 --> 00:18:21,220
How the hell should I know?

206
00:18:21,220 --> 00:18:22,279
I was just asking her

207
00:18:22,279 --> 00:18:22,759
to dance.

208
00:18:22,819 --> 00:18:24,259
And she splashed me head to toe!

209
00:18:25,059 --> 00:18:25,779
Today, she is

210
00:18:25,839 --> 00:18:27,079
a tigress on the rampage.

211
00:18:27,160 --> 00:18:28,359
Piss her off, she'll eat you alive.

212
00:18:28,359 --> 00:18:29,779
Leave her alone, she'll still eat you alive.

213
00:18:29,960 --> 00:18:30,660
Better stay out of her way.

214
00:18:30,940 --> 00:18:31,319
Let's bail.

215
00:18:31,319 --> 00:18:31,680
Later.

216
00:18:35,900 --> 00:18:36,640
He's got a point.

217
00:19:07,359 --> 00:19:08,380
The world seldom

218
00:19:09,019 --> 00:19:10,420
sees Miss Tao in such high spirits.

219
00:19:10,900 --> 00:19:12,019
It's not even dark,

220
00:19:12,299 --> 00:19:13,099
and she's already drunk.

221
00:19:14,859 --> 00:19:15,740
My business

222
00:19:15,980 --> 00:19:17,799
is none of yours.

223
00:19:18,160 --> 00:19:18,740
How about this?

224
00:19:19,420 --> 00:19:21,299
Tell me who pissed you off,

225
00:19:24,420 --> 00:19:26,700
and I'll get even with them for you.

226
00:19:37,900 --> 00:19:38,759
Get lost.

227
00:19:55,900 --> 00:19:56,839
Listen,

228
00:19:57,920 --> 00:19:59,220
whoever that bastard is,

229
00:20:00,319 --> 00:20:02,000
they're not worth getting upset over.

230
00:20:02,420 --> 00:20:03,319
You are the only one

231
00:20:03,319 --> 00:20:04,220
that matters.

232
00:20:04,960 --> 00:20:05,759
You got it?

233
00:20:27,380 --> 00:20:28,599
Li Boren,

234
00:20:29,900 --> 00:20:31,960
when I'm sober in the day,

235
00:20:32,660 --> 00:20:34,359
you always pull that devil-may-care face.

236
00:20:35,400 --> 00:20:37,220
Now that I'm drunk,

237
00:20:38,400 --> 00:20:40,200
you're suddenly acting like a gentleman.

238
00:20:50,599 --> 00:20:51,799
Let's... let's take you home.

239
00:20:52,259 --> 00:20:53,720
Let go! I'm not going home!

240
00:20:53,900 --> 00:20:55,099
Please, be reasonable.

241
00:20:55,099 --> 00:20:55,680
I'm not leaving.

242
00:20:55,720 --> 00:20:56,259
I'm not leaving.

243
00:20:56,259 --> 00:20:56,660
Come on, no more drinks.

244
00:20:56,660 --> 00:20:57,460
I'm not going!

245
00:21:21,940 --> 00:21:22,519
Well?

246
00:21:23,900 --> 00:21:25,099
Feeling better now?

247
00:21:25,359 --> 00:21:26,180
Can we go now?

248
00:21:32,859 --> 00:21:34,720
How come you're not angry?

249
00:21:37,160 --> 00:21:37,839
Grown out of it.

250
00:21:39,019 --> 00:21:39,460
Come on.

251
00:21:40,859 --> 00:21:41,220
Come on.

252
00:21:42,859 --> 00:21:43,539
Here. Easy now.

253
00:21:56,200 --> 00:21:57,359
The military drills just wrapped up,

254
00:21:57,400 --> 00:21:58,900
and the arsenal is swamped with work.

255
00:21:59,099 --> 00:22:00,059
What on earth is going on?

256
00:22:00,400 --> 00:22:01,259
Young master has stayed at Redleaf

257
00:22:01,319 --> 00:22:02,380
for three days straight.

258
00:22:02,380 --> 00:22:03,240
Not answering a single call.

259
00:22:16,299 --> 00:22:17,819
Seriously, what's up?

260
00:22:23,019 --> 00:22:24,640
Major Li, what brings you here?

261
00:22:24,759 --> 00:22:25,839
Is young master alright?

262
00:22:25,940 --> 00:22:27,119
Miss Ye hasn't had a bite

263
00:22:27,119 --> 00:22:28,160
or a sip in three days.

264
00:22:28,299 --> 00:22:28,839
The master

265
00:22:28,839 --> 00:22:30,680
is at Miss Ye's side right now.

266
00:22:42,680 --> 00:22:43,519
Did she ever wake up?

267
00:22:44,559 --> 00:22:45,779
No. She's unconscious all the time.

268
00:22:45,940 --> 00:22:46,980
Her fever has not gone down, either.

269
00:22:47,420 --> 00:22:48,720
But her fingers just moved.

270
00:22:49,119 --> 00:22:50,480
She's probably awake,

271
00:22:50,680 --> 00:22:51,519
but won't open her eyes.

272
00:22:57,779 --> 00:22:58,680
Get her to eat some congee.

273
00:22:59,019 --> 00:22:59,900
Then give her the medicine.

274
00:23:00,180 --> 00:23:00,640
Yes, sir.

275
00:23:05,019 --> 00:23:05,819
Miss Ye.

276
00:23:05,980 --> 00:23:07,359
Have some congee, please.

277
00:23:08,779 --> 00:23:09,579
Miss Ye.

278
00:23:19,579 --> 00:23:20,460
Get her another bowl.

279
00:23:21,099 --> 00:23:21,720
Yes.

280
00:23:31,359 --> 00:23:32,160
Ye Pingjun.

281
00:23:33,180 --> 00:23:34,839
I've put up with your tantrum for three days.

282
00:23:35,460 --> 00:23:36,059
Do you

283
00:23:36,059 --> 00:23:37,259
seriously think I'll pamper

284
00:23:37,839 --> 00:23:39,180
your petty, little death wish?

285
00:23:45,420 --> 00:23:46,599
If you've got the nerve to die,

286
00:23:47,779 --> 00:23:48,559
I'll make sure

287
00:23:48,559 --> 00:23:50,279
Jiang Xueting doesn't live past tonight.

288
00:24:07,119 --> 00:24:08,079
What did you say?

289
00:24:10,380 --> 00:24:11,759
Jiang Xueting is not dead.

290
00:24:19,019 --> 00:24:19,799
That's a lie.

291
00:24:30,559 --> 00:24:31,859
But if you kill yourself,

292
00:24:33,259 --> 00:24:34,680
I'll see to it

293
00:24:34,680 --> 00:24:36,019
he join you soon.

294
00:24:39,039 --> 00:24:39,799
No.

295
00:24:43,720 --> 00:24:44,480
That can't be true.

296
00:24:45,660 --> 00:24:47,359
They say he was executed.

297
00:24:50,119 --> 00:24:51,119
Believe it or not.

298
00:25:09,240 --> 00:25:09,859
Young master.

299
00:25:21,799 --> 00:25:22,400
Open your mouth.

300
00:26:08,339 --> 00:26:09,319
Open up.

301
00:26:33,259 --> 00:26:33,859
Oh, crap.

302
00:26:35,019 --> 00:26:36,119
Crap, crap, crap.

303
00:26:38,160 --> 00:26:38,960
I thought Changxuan

304
00:26:38,960 --> 00:26:39,759
fancies Miss Ye

305
00:26:39,759 --> 00:26:40,880
because she is

306
00:26:40,880 --> 00:26:42,539
pretty, dramatic and recalcitrant,

307
00:26:42,539 --> 00:26:43,519
and he found it amusing.

308
00:26:44,059 --> 00:26:45,220
But now that I think about it,

309
00:26:46,119 --> 00:26:47,480
Changxuan cares about Ye Pingjun

310
00:26:47,680 --> 00:26:49,039
even more than he cares about

311
00:26:49,039 --> 00:26:50,019
his own life.

312
00:26:51,519 --> 00:26:53,859
I took him to be a player.

313
00:26:55,319 --> 00:26:57,319
Turns out he's truly head over heels.

314
00:27:01,579 --> 00:27:02,339
We'd better

315
00:27:02,339 --> 00:27:03,319
take a rain check.

316
00:27:04,319 --> 00:27:05,000
Let's head back.

317
00:27:07,819 --> 00:27:08,759
No more eavesdropping?

318
00:27:09,619 --> 00:27:11,099
You really don't care at all, do you?

319
00:27:26,019 --> 00:27:26,819
Pingjun.

320
00:28:03,279 --> 00:28:04,559
For this life and every life after,

321
00:28:06,599 --> 00:28:07,799
you're mine alone.

322
00:28:10,119 --> 00:28:11,480
No one can take you away from me.

323
00:28:43,920 --> 00:28:44,299
Freeze.

324
00:28:55,859 --> 00:28:56,460
Commander.

325
00:28:56,660 --> 00:28:58,140
Shang Hongwen has been seized by Yu Changxuan.

326
00:28:58,519 --> 00:28:59,319
No telling if he

327
00:28:59,319 --> 00:29:00,240
can keep his mouth shut.

328
00:29:01,259 --> 00:29:03,059
Let's see how much he care about

329
00:29:04,200 --> 00:29:05,619
the lives of his wife and children.

330
00:29:08,240 --> 00:29:09,839
Yu Changxuan...

331
00:29:11,660 --> 00:29:12,819
I've found myself

332
00:29:12,819 --> 00:29:14,819
quite an opponent, haven't I?

333
00:29:20,579 --> 00:29:23,680
We shall see.

334
00:29:36,799 --> 00:29:37,160
Move!

335
00:29:41,880 --> 00:29:42,359
Quit dawdling!

336
00:29:48,759 --> 00:29:49,259
Move it!

337
00:29:50,539 --> 00:29:50,900
Hurry!

338
00:30:02,119 --> 00:30:02,500
Move!

339
00:30:03,160 --> 00:30:03,519
Faster!

340
00:30:08,700 --> 00:30:09,059
Move!

341
00:30:14,779 --> 00:30:15,259
Hurry!

342
00:30:23,680 --> 00:30:24,140
Get up there!

343
00:31:02,680 --> 00:31:04,039
You submitted the evidence.

344
00:31:05,059 --> 00:31:06,500
You arrested the man.

345
00:31:07,640 --> 00:31:08,420
And now,

346
00:31:09,079 --> 00:31:10,980
you demand a release.

347
00:31:11,880 --> 00:31:13,940
You can't just go back on your word on a whim.

348
00:31:14,579 --> 00:31:16,579
You owe me an explanation.

349
00:31:19,779 --> 00:31:20,839
It's for that girl, isn't it?

350
00:31:21,559 --> 00:31:22,960
That Miss Ye, for whom

351
00:31:22,960 --> 00:31:24,079
you took a knife.

352
00:31:24,539 --> 00:31:25,420
Curiously enough,

353
00:31:25,420 --> 00:31:27,099
she happens to be Jiang Xueting's fiancée.

354
00:31:27,559 --> 00:31:28,579
Do you seriously

355
00:31:29,200 --> 00:31:30,799
think we can't piece it together?

356
00:31:32,019 --> 00:31:32,940
A man in command

357
00:31:33,380 --> 00:31:34,259
must never

358
00:31:34,440 --> 00:31:36,539
let personal feelings get in the way.

359
00:31:45,880 --> 00:31:47,180
I'll arrange for Jiang Xueting

360
00:31:47,279 --> 00:31:48,579
to visit your mother in the hospital,

361
00:31:49,019 --> 00:31:50,119
so she can rest easy.

362
00:31:51,160 --> 00:31:51,960
But after that,

363
00:31:52,559 --> 00:31:53,259
he will go to Jiangzhou

364
00:31:53,259 --> 00:31:54,380
for three months of hard labor.

365
00:31:57,660 --> 00:31:58,519
And after that?

366
00:32:00,519 --> 00:32:01,759
This is not up for debate.

367
00:32:01,880 --> 00:32:02,980
No exception.

368
00:32:04,420 --> 00:32:05,099
But once he

369
00:32:05,099 --> 00:32:06,380
walks out of this prison,

370
00:32:06,619 --> 00:32:08,119
he will be out of danger.

371
00:32:09,319 --> 00:32:10,180
Three months,

372
00:32:11,079 --> 00:32:12,960
and he will be set completely free.

373
00:32:16,480 --> 00:32:18,019
But we're not done. The terms must change.

374
00:32:20,119 --> 00:32:21,559
One year is far too soon.

375
00:32:28,119 --> 00:32:29,460
How long do you want, then?

376
00:32:33,380 --> 00:32:34,279
A lifetime.

377
00:32:43,299 --> 00:32:44,279
A lifetime?

378
00:32:46,380 --> 00:32:47,279
Yu Changxuan,

379
00:32:48,460 --> 00:32:49,299
this toxic

380
00:32:49,299 --> 00:32:50,519
secret we share,

381
00:32:50,519 --> 00:32:52,119
you want it to last a lifetime?

382
00:32:53,359 --> 00:32:54,720
You're sick.

383
00:33:09,519 --> 00:33:10,420
You said your world and mine

384
00:33:10,420 --> 00:33:11,500
can never bleed into one.

385
00:33:11,619 --> 00:33:12,559
If that's the case,

386
00:33:13,819 --> 00:33:14,559
I'll just have to

387
00:33:14,559 --> 00:33:15,420
pull you

388
00:33:15,420 --> 00:33:16,279
into mine.

389
00:33:19,920 --> 00:33:21,359
And what if I say no?

390
00:33:24,380 --> 00:33:25,180
Are you gonna

391
00:33:25,180 --> 00:33:26,660
have Xueting arrested again

392
00:33:28,619 --> 00:33:30,180
and coerce me into obedience?

393
00:33:35,559 --> 00:33:36,960
That's feasible.

394
00:34:19,619 --> 00:34:20,480
Ye Pingjun.

395
00:34:23,320 --> 00:34:24,880
My patience's wearing too thin.

396
00:34:27,679 --> 00:34:28,380
Can't you feel it?

397
00:34:48,980 --> 00:34:50,579
Those in opera

398
00:34:50,880 --> 00:34:53,559
must never make a mistake onstage.

399
00:34:54,880 --> 00:34:57,320
One mistake, and it makes the papers.

400
00:34:58,360 --> 00:35:01,639
Your whole career could be ruined.

401
00:35:03,800 --> 00:35:04,739
You don't have to

402
00:35:04,739 --> 00:35:05,679
while away your life here.

403
00:35:06,860 --> 00:35:07,780
If a new destination

404
00:35:07,780 --> 00:35:08,719
ever comes to your mind,

405
00:35:09,420 --> 00:35:10,679
I'll clear the paths for you.

406
00:35:11,579 --> 00:35:12,719
I'm not going anywhere.

407
00:35:15,420 --> 00:35:16,679
I'm rooted here.

408
00:35:17,579 --> 00:35:19,260
Whenever you feel like hearing a fine tune,

409
00:35:20,719 --> 00:35:21,579
you know where to go.

410
00:36:13,119 --> 00:36:15,500
I've heard what's been happening to you lately.

411
00:36:16,320 --> 00:36:17,500
But life is like a play.

412
00:36:18,420 --> 00:36:19,900
How can everything go our way?

413
00:36:21,699 --> 00:36:23,059
The twists and turns will all pass.

414
00:36:24,820 --> 00:36:26,400
Thank you, Director Liang.

415
00:36:28,000 --> 00:36:29,539
It's just that

416
00:36:29,960 --> 00:36:31,219
life goes on after

417
00:36:32,300 --> 00:36:33,500
the curtains are drawn.

418
00:36:35,139 --> 00:36:35,760
Lan Qing.

419
00:36:37,920 --> 00:36:39,019
Have you noticed

420
00:36:44,360 --> 00:36:45,619
you've changed a little lately?

421
00:36:47,400 --> 00:36:48,199
What do you mean?

422
00:36:50,019 --> 00:36:52,019
The day Pingjun and I discussed the script,

423
00:36:53,460 --> 00:36:55,000
you didn't give Mr. Yu the tour around

424
00:36:55,260 --> 00:36:56,440
for nothing, did you?

425
00:37:02,059 --> 00:37:02,960
For the next scene,

426
00:37:03,119 --> 00:37:04,659
I want him to say these words

427
00:37:04,820 --> 00:37:06,300
right outside the school gates.

428
00:37:19,360 --> 00:37:20,840
I don't know what you're talking about.

429
00:37:23,699 --> 00:37:24,920
You don't have to admit it.

430
00:37:27,019 --> 00:37:28,260
I want you to know

431
00:37:31,719 --> 00:37:32,639
that you've always

432
00:37:33,760 --> 00:37:35,079
been a warm, kind-hearted person.

433
00:37:35,960 --> 00:37:37,260
People get lost sometimes,

434
00:37:37,699 --> 00:37:38,519
but that

435
00:37:39,579 --> 00:37:40,800
doesn't change who they are.

436
00:37:42,900 --> 00:37:43,699
I've heard

437
00:37:44,900 --> 00:37:46,260
bits and pieces

438
00:37:47,059 --> 00:37:48,599
about you and Yu Mingxuan.

439
00:37:48,699 --> 00:37:50,260
That's all in the past.

440
00:37:50,699 --> 00:37:51,699
I don't want to talk about it.

441
00:37:51,900 --> 00:37:52,699
All right.

442
00:37:53,300 --> 00:37:54,059
As you wish.

443
00:37:55,719 --> 00:37:56,599
You know,

444
00:37:57,019 --> 00:37:57,760
we are all

445
00:37:59,360 --> 00:38:01,079
made of our own obsessions.

446
00:38:02,119 --> 00:38:03,420
We feel impelled to do what we do.

447
00:38:04,159 --> 00:38:07,260
Greed, hatred, delusion, and false thoughts...

448
00:38:07,500 --> 00:38:08,960
Scheming and struggling,..

449
00:38:09,619 --> 00:38:11,159
They are all passing thoughts.

450
00:38:12,500 --> 00:38:13,599
Looking back at it,

451
00:38:14,519 --> 00:38:15,820
nothing really matters.

452
00:38:17,119 --> 00:38:18,599
With a background like mine,

453
00:38:19,519 --> 00:38:20,860
who can be my shield

454
00:38:22,780 --> 00:38:24,099
in such a chaotic world?

455
00:38:26,380 --> 00:38:27,280
If it will not come to you,

456
00:38:27,639 --> 00:38:28,659
go seize it.

457
00:38:29,460 --> 00:38:30,619
This is an era

458
00:38:30,840 --> 00:38:31,760
where a woman can be

459
00:38:31,760 --> 00:38:32,820
her own source of support.

460
00:38:33,699 --> 00:38:35,760
If you are willing to learn to read and write,

461
00:38:35,760 --> 00:38:36,659
I can be your teacher.

462
00:38:36,920 --> 00:38:38,159
With literacy,

463
00:38:38,559 --> 00:38:39,139
you can

464
00:38:39,500 --> 00:38:41,159
do all sorts of things you love

465
00:38:41,300 --> 00:38:43,059
and fathom the vastness of the world.

466
00:38:45,719 --> 00:38:47,519
I entered this profession when I was four.

467
00:38:48,559 --> 00:38:49,760
Apart from performing opera,

468
00:38:50,820 --> 00:38:52,059
I have nothing to fall back on.

469
00:38:52,780 --> 00:38:54,179
Learning to read and write now

470
00:38:54,320 --> 00:38:55,619
seems far too late.

471
00:38:56,420 --> 00:38:57,400
All these years,

472
00:38:57,980 --> 00:39:00,719
I've seen so many women, green and grown,

473
00:39:01,460 --> 00:39:02,619
wives and concubines.

474
00:39:03,860 --> 00:39:05,199
Even the most capable ones

475
00:39:06,619 --> 00:39:07,780
drift alone in this world

476
00:39:08,820 --> 00:39:10,219
like dandelion seeds in a gale.

477
00:39:12,019 --> 00:39:13,039
With no one to cling onto,

478
00:39:14,559 --> 00:39:15,860
she cannot survive by herself.

479
00:39:43,179 --> 00:39:43,860
Sir!

480
00:39:45,559 --> 00:39:46,280
Sir!

481
00:39:48,280 --> 00:39:48,940
Sir!

482
00:39:49,460 --> 00:39:51,320
Miss Ye won't stay in her bedroom.

483
00:39:52,280 --> 00:39:52,940
Where did she go?

484
00:39:54,179 --> 00:39:56,380
The garden.

485
00:39:57,019 --> 00:39:58,159
None of us can get near her.

486
00:39:58,820 --> 00:40:00,440
She's just sitting out there in the rain.

487
00:40:01,119 --> 00:40:02,000
She seems

488
00:40:02,000 --> 00:40:03,320
so bent on self sabotaging.

489
00:40:04,659 --> 00:40:05,559
Been drenching herself

490
00:40:05,719 --> 00:40:06,719
all afternoon.

491
00:41:11,219 --> 00:41:12,179
Yu Changxuan.

492
00:41:16,880 --> 00:41:18,360
I'm in.

493
00:41:20,400 --> 00:41:22,059
Let's say I owed you in a past life.
